    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Reservations are now open, with completion expected in early 2027. Register your interest at www.theleys.ie\r\n\r\nHelp to Buy and First Home Scheme accepted (subject to eligibility and scheme conditions).\r\n\r\nGround Floor — Fully reserved\r\nFirst Floor — Fully reserved\r\nSecond Floor — €510,000\r\nThird Floor — €520,000\r\nFourth Floor — €530,000\r\n\r\nThe 2-bedroom apartments at The Leys offer spacious, contemporary living in one of Dublin 18's most sought-after locations. These A-rated homes combine modern design, excellent energy efficiency and high-quality finishes.\r\n\r\nIdeally located just minutes from the Luas Green Line and M50, The Leys offers excellent connectivity alongside the convenience and lifestyle of Dublin 18."
